    {
      "source": "The configured path matching options will be used for mapping to\nannotated controllers and also\n<a href=\"WebFluxConfigurer.html#addResourceHandlers(org.springframework.web.reactive.config.ResourceHandlerRegistry)\"><code>static resources</code></a>.",
      "translation": "配置的路径匹配选项将用于映射到带注解的控制器以及\n<a href=\"WebFluxConfigurer.html#addResourceHandlers(org.springframework.web.reactive.config.ResourceHandlerRegistry)\"><code>静态资源</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add to the list of <a href=\"../../ErrorResponse.Interceptor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web\"><code>ErrorResponse.Interceptor</code></a>'s to invoke when\nrendering an RFC 9457 <a href=\"../../../http/ProblemDetail.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>ProblemDetail</code></a>\nerror response.",
      "translation": "添加到调用以渲染 RFC 9457 <a href=\"../../../http/ProblemDetail.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>ProblemDetail</code></a>错误响应的<a href=\"../../ErrorResponse.Interceptor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web\"><code>ErrorResponse.Interceptor</code></a>列表中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add custom <a href=\"../../../core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converters</code></a> and <a href=\"../../../format/Formatter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>Formatters</code></a> for\nperforming type conversion and formatting of annotated controller method arguments.",
      "translation": "添加自定义的<a href=\"../../../core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converters</code></a>和<a href=\"../../../format/Formatter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.format\"><code>Formatters</code></a>，以执行对注解的控制器方法参数的类型转换和格式化。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Provide a custom <a href=\"../../../validation/MessageCodesResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>MessageCodesResolver</code></a> to use for data binding in\nannotated controller method arguments instead of the one created by\ndefault in <a href=\"../../../validation/DataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation\"><code>DataBinder</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为注解控制器方法参数中的数据绑定提供一个自定义的<a href=\"../../../validation/MessageCodesResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.validation\"><code>MessageCodesResolver</code></a>，而不是使用在<a href=\"../../../validation/DataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation\"><code>DataBinder</code></a>中默认创建的实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
