    {
      "source": "Annotated controllers can further declare more fine-grained config via\n<a href=\"../../bind/annotation/CrossOrigin.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>@CrossOrigin</code></a>.\nIn such cases \"global\" CORS configuration declared here is\n<a href=\"../../cors/CorsConfiguration.html#combine(org.springframework.web.cors.CorsConfiguration)\"><code>combined</code></a>\nwith local CORS configuration defined on a controller method.",
      "translation": "注释控制器可以通过 <a href=\"../../bind/annotation/CrossOrigin.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>@CrossOrigin</code></a> 声明更细粒度的配置。在这种情况下，此处声明的“全局”CORS 配置将与控制器方法上定义的本地 CORS 配置进行 <a href=\"../../cors/CorsConfiguration.html#combine(org.springframework.web.cors.CorsConfiguration)\"><code>合并</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "By default, all built-in readers and writers are configured as long as\nthe corresponding 3rd party libraries such Jackson JSON, JAXB2, and others\nare present on the classpath.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，只要类路径中存在相应的第三方库（如 Jackson JSON、JAXB2 等），所有内置的读写器都会进行配置。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "By default a validator for standard bean validation is created if\nbean validation API is present on the classpath.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，如果类路径中存在 Bean Validation API，将创建一个用于标准 Bean Validation 的验证器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The configured validator is used for validating annotated controller\nmethod arguments.",
      "translation": "配置的验证器用于验证带有注解的控制器方法参数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The configured view resolvers will be used for both annotated\ncontrollers and functional endpoints.",
      "translation": "已配置的视图解析器将同时用于带注解的控制器和功能端点。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Provide the <a href=\"../socket/server/WebSocketService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.socket.server\"><code>WebSocketService</code></a> to create\n<a href=\"../socket/server/support/WebSocketHandlerAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive.socket.server.support\"><code>WebSocketHandlerAdapter</code></a>\nwith. This can be used to configure server-specific properties through the\n<a href=\"../socket/server/RequestUpgradeStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.socket.server\"><code>RequestUpgradeStrategy</code></a>.",
      "translation": "提供 <a href=\"../socket/server/WebSocketService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.socket.server\"><code>WebSocketService</code></a> 以创建\n<a href=\"../socket/server/support/WebSocketHandlerAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive.socket.server.support\"><code>WebSocketHandlerAdapter</code></a>。可以通过\n<a href=\"../socket/server/RequestUpgradeStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.socket.server\"><code>RequestUpgradeStrategy</code></a> 来配置特定于服务器的属性。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Provide the <a href=\"../socket/server/WebSocketService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.socket.server\"><code>WebSocketService</code></a> to create\n<a href=\"../socket/server/support/WebSocketHandlerAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive.socket.server.support\"><code>WebSocketHandlerAdapter</code></a>\nwith.",
      "translation": "提供 <a href=\"../socket/server/WebSocketService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.socket.server\"><code>WebSocketService</code></a> 以创建\n<a href=\"../socket/server/support/WebSocketHandlerAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive.socket.server.support\"><code>WebSocketHandlerAdapter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
