      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure \"global\" cross-origin request processing.",
      "translation": "配置“全局”跨域请求处理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure API versioning for the application.",
      "translation": "配置应用程序的 API 版本控制。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure the HTTP message readers and writers for reading from the\nrequest body and for writing to the response body in annotated controllers\nand functional endpoints.",
      "translation": "在注解式控制器和函数式端点中，配置用于从请求体读取以及向响应体写入的 HTTP 消息读取器和写入器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure path matching options.",
      "translation": "配置路径匹配选项。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure view resolution for rendering responses with a view and a model,\nwhere the view is typically an HTML template but could also be based on\nan HTTP message writer (for example, JSON, XML).",
      "translation": "配置视图解析器以渲染包含视图和模型的响应，其中视图通常是 HTML 模板，但也可能基于 HTTP 消息写入器（例如 JSON、XML）。",
      "count": 1
